35		//! If this returns RESULT_READY, the Execute function can be called to obtain a pointer to the result.
36		//! If this returns RESULT_NOT_READY, the ExecuteTask function should be called again.
37		//! If this returns EXECUTION_ERROR, an error occurred during execution.
38		//! If this returns NO_TASKS_AVAILABLE, this means currently no meaningful work can be done by the current executor,
39		//!	    but tasks may become available in the future.
40		//! The error message can be obtained by calling GetError() on the PendingQueryResult.
41		DUCKDB_API PendingExecutionResult ExecuteTask();
